  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8760269db515c5e44a68cd6cd5ab73f3, type: 3}
  m_Name: TaskGive1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  isTaskDialogue: 1
  giveTaskDialogue: 'Ahh, and as the night dawns, so too doth this nightguard of
    mine. Prithee, guardian of such fallen daylight, might a woman of such wonton
    nature make a request?

    Mine obsessive love furrows to my heart, wouldst
    thou deliver unto love itself a whisper on the wind?

    Convey unto him, this
    tale: oh, dearest Romeo, hither to my heart, hither to my lungs, they rest within
    thy hands.

    When the night shifts to its peak, might a song whisper in these
    decrepit halls and cast thy vanity aside.

    I beseech thee, Romeo, to accompany
    me through the gaze of such moonlit eyes.

'
